>
	<section id="work-exp" class="bgWhite ofsInBottom">
		<div class="experience">
			<Title title="Work Experience" />

			<div class="content d-grid gap-5">
				{/* Caterpillar */}
				<div class="text-body">
					<h4>Caterpillar &mdash; via COMTEK International</h4>
					<h6 class="text-muted">
						Machine Learning Engineer | Barcelona, Spain | May 2026 - Present
					</h6>
					<ul>
						<li>
							Build and own Pampas, the LLM evaluation framework that assesses AI
							assistant outputs across cloud and in-cab environments for the Cat In-Cab
							Assistant, covering the judging methodology, the test corpus, and the
							release pipeline that gates every change.
						</li>
						<li>
							Designed the judging methodology &mdash; binary Accept/Reject rubrics, a
