							publishing.
						</li>
						<li>
							Extracted the framework into a shared p-evaluation-framework library with
							typed AgentScenario / TypedDict contracts, plus LangGraph todo middleware,
							reasoning-level Langfuse tagging, and per-run timing reports.
						</li>
					</ul>
				</div>

